<name>EFI System (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM0000026XZ01AX" category="C" type-id="8021M" name-id="068EV-01" from="200912">
<dtccode>P0443/94</dtccode>
<dtcname>EVAP Purge Control D-VSV Open Circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000026XZ01AX_05" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I2B00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>To prevent emissions, fuel vapor generated in the fuel tank assembly is sent through the charcoal canister assembly to the intake air surge tank assembly and burned in the cylinders. The canister purge volume changes according to the driving conditions as the engine control computer controls the opening and closing of vacuum switching valve assembly No.1.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1" pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="C01" colwidth="0.85in"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="C02" colwidth="3.04in"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="3.19in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<ptxt>1. Detection condition 2. Malfunction status 3. Malfunction duration 4. Other</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P0443/94</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>+B terminal voltage is 10 V or more and the duty ratio of the vacuum switching valve drive signal inside the engine control computer is 5 to 95% (purge VSV being driven)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The vacuum switching valve drive output duty voltage (PRG terminal) is not generated in response to the vacuum switching valve drive signal inside the engine control computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>10 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Vacuum Switching Valve Assembly No.1</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness or Connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A166614J01" width="7.106578999in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
