<ptxt>(to Vacuum Switching Valve Assembly No.1)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0004" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I2800000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Vacuum Switching Valve Assembly NO.1 - Engine Control Computer)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D705AX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the vacuum switching valve assembly No.1 connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="X39400000QV016D"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance (Check for Open)</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.41in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>Engine control computer vehicle side connector - Vacuum switching valve assembly No.1 vehicle side connector</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A49(PRG) - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Resistance (Check for Short)</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.41in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>Engine control computer vehicle side connector and vacuum switching valve assembly No.1 vehicle side connector - Other terminals and body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A49 (PRG) and 2 - Other terminals and body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0010" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0009" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I2900000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0011" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0011" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I2A00000">
<testtitle>Perform Operation Check Drive</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Start the engine, turn all accessory switches OFF, and warm up the engine until the engine coolant temperature stabilizes. (Engine coolant temperature 75°C or higher) (A)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A179391J02" width="7.106578999in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Idle the engine for 15 minutes or more. (B)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, select main menu [Diagnosis] - diagnosis menu [Powertrain] - [TCCS] - system diagnosis menu [DTC Judgment Result Check] - [Check by DTC].</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>On the next screen, enter the DTC to be checked.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTC judgment result.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" align="center" colwidth="0.62in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.51in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Display Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Description</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>DTC judgment completed</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>System Normal</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>DTC judgment completed</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>System Malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Judging</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>DTC judgment not completed</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>After checking the detection conditions, perform a road test</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Judgment not possible</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>DTC judgment cannot be performed</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The number of DTCs whose preconditions are not met has reached the upper limit that can be stored in the engine control computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>After checking the detection conditions, perform a road test</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</atten4>
<atten2>
<ptxt>When performing this driving test, be sure to obey speed limits and other traffic laws.</ptxt>
</atten2>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the DTC judgment result is "judging" or "cannot judge", drive the vehicle at 40 to 60 km/h for 10 minutes or more (C), then check the DTC judgment result.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0008" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000026XZ01AX_04_0012" fin="true">B</right>
